menu "WiSense Servo (privacy flap)"

    config WISENSE_SERVO_GPIO
        int "Servo signal GPIO"
        default 13
        help
            LEDC PWM output to the servo signal wire. Default is a placeholder
            picked for ESP32-CAM bring-up notes; re-check against the real
            ESP32-S3 board's pinout (some GPIO numbers are reserved for
            octal PSRAM/flash on many S3 modules) before first flash.

    config WISENSE_SERVO_PWM_FREQ_HZ
        int "Servo PWM frequency (Hz)"
        default 50
        help
            Standard hobby servo control frequency (20 ms period).

    config WISENSE_SERVO_MIN_PULSE_US
        int "Pulse width at 0 degrees (us)"
        range 400 3000
        default 500
        help
            Servo datasheet minimum pulse width, corresponding to 0 degrees.
            SG90-class servos are typically ~500us; adjust to your servo.

    config WISENSE_SERVO_MAX_PULSE_US
        int "Pulse width at 180 degrees (us)"
        range 400 3000
        default 2500
        help
            Servo datasheet maximum pulse width, corresponding to 180
            degrees. SG90-class servos are typically ~2500us.

    config WISENSE_SERVO_CLOSED_ANGLE_DEG
        int "Closed/idle angle (degrees)"
        range 0 180
        default 0
        help
            Flap closed over the phone (idle / no emergency). Also the
            position forced at boot.

    config WISENSE_SERVO_OPEN_ANGLE_DEG
        int "Open/alert angle (degrees)"
        range 0 180
        default 90
        help
            Flap open, exposing the phone, once a fall alert fires.

endmenu
